{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05271","headline":"奉和初春幸太平公主南庄应制 · 赵彦昭","name":"奉和初春幸太平公主南庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主第岩扃驾鹊桥，天门阊阖降鸾镳。\n历乱旌旗转云树，参差台榭入烟霄。\n林间花杂平阳舞，谷里莺和弄玉箫。\n已陪沁水追欢日，行奉茅山访道朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵彦昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}